{%- comment -%} RankSurge HD icons. Usage: render 'rs-icon', name: 'search'. Optional: class: 'x'; size: 52 (px, default 24).
  Per-game icons (v53, David's request): the Sidekick tile image rs-icon2-<game>.png from Content > Files is used at EVERY size
  (nav, chips, cards, lookup) through the images global, with a 1x/2x/3x srcset (2x/4x/6x of the box: 48/96/144 for 24px,
  104/208/312 for 52px) so it stays sharp on retina. If the file is not uploaded yet, the inline SVG glyph is used, so nothing breaks.
  The old rs-icon-<game>.png files (checkerboard backgrounds) are deliberately not used.
  Expected files (16): rs-icon2-valorant.png, rs-icon2-league-of-legends.png, rs-icon2-tft.png, rs-icon2-counter-strike-2.png,
  rs-icon2-deadlock.png, rs-icon2-dota-2.png, rs-icon2-pubg.png, rs-icon2-destiny-2.png, rs-icon2-wow.png, rs-icon2-marvel-rivals.png,
  rs-icon2-overwatch-2.png, rs-icon2-fortnite.png, and (v59) rs-icon2-sc2.png, rs-icon2-brawl-stars.png, rs-icon2-clash-royale.png,
  rs-icon2-clash-of-clans.png, and (v64) rs-icon2-world-of-tanks.png and rs-icon2-chess.png,
  and (v67) rs-icon2-lichess.png, rs-icon2-osu.png, rs-icon2-hypixel.png, rs-icon2-world-of-warships.png, rs-icon2-world-of-tanks-blitz.png {%- endcomment -%}
